  {
   "fieldname": "cost_calculation_details",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "label": "Cost Calculation Details",
   "options": "<div style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color: #007bff;\">Cost Calculation Details</h4>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Instructions</h5>\n        <p>Please ensure all relevant fields are filled out correctly. The calculations are based on various factors including contract duration, monthly salary, and specific allowances. Below are the detailed descriptions and types of costs considered in the calculations.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Contract Duration</h5>\n        <p>The contract duration is determined by the number of days between the start and end dates.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Salary and Allowances</h5>\n        <p>The monthly salary is used to calculate the following allowances:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Food</li>\n            <li>Housing</li>\n            <li>Transportation</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>It also includes:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>General Organization for Social Insurance (GOSI)</li>\n            <li>End-of-service benefits</li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Leave Salary</h5>\n        <p>The leave salary is calculated based on 21 days of leave per year.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Annual Costs</h5>\n        <p>Annual costs such as air tickets, medical insurance, and other fees are converted to monthly values.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Recruitment Costs</h5>\n        <p>If the employment type is 'Recruitment', costs such as visa, international recruitment fees, and sponsorship transfer fees are included based on a 24-month contract.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Specific Costs</h5>\n        <p>For positions like 'Worker' or 'Delivery Representative', specific costs are considered:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Uniform</li>\n            <li>Safety shoes</li>\n            <li>Cleaning supplies</li>\n            <li>Mobile</li>\n            <li>Sim card</li>\n            <li>Vehicle</li>\n            <li>Fuel</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Housing and transportation costs are added if applicable.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Total Cost Calculation</h5>\n        <p>The total cost includes the components listed above along with:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Commissions</li>\n            <li>General administrative expenses</li>\n            <li>Saudization expenses</li>\n            <li>Overtime costs (calculated for hours worked beyond the standard 8 hours per day at 1.5 times the hourly rate)</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>The total cost per worker is aggregated, and then multiplied by the number of employees. The document calculates the final total cost by adding the profit margin and value-added tax (VAT) to the total cost.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n        <h5>Calculation Types</h5>\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n            <thead style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n                <tr>\n                    <th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Cost Type</th>\n                    <th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Calculation Frequency</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Work Permit</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Annual</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Iqama Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Annual</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Medical Insurance</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Annual</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Ajeer Fees</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Annual</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Visa Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">24 Months</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Sponsorship Transfer Fees</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">24 Months</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Uniform Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">12 Months</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Safety Shoes Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">12 Months</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Cleaning Supplies Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Monthly</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Mobile Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Annual</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Sim Card Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Monthly</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Vehicle Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Monthly</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Fuel Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Monthly</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Housing Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Monthly</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Transportation Cost</td>\n                    <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">Monthly</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </section>\n</div>\n"
  },
